      "message": "\u003e Could we have the vendor / init boot partitions re-export information about the ramdisk, so that we don\u0027t have to list more than necessary on the module?\n\nGood idea, I have uploaded a new patchset which does this.\n\nMy `target_files.zip` testing is limited (only aosp CF for now), but I think we need these special cases. e.g. removing this\n```\ntoCopy \u003d append(toCopy, targetFilesZipCopy{a.partitionProps.Recovery_partition_name, \"VENDOR_BOOT/RAMDISK\"})\n```\n\nCauses the recovery files to be missing in the soong built `VENDOR_BOOT/RAMDISK` subdir of target_files.zip. Would you know how we can get this information from the autogenerated `vendor_boot` bootimg module?",
